    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA fantastic opportunity to acquire a turnkey five-bedroom family home, ideally located within walking distance of Killarney town centre and the renowned Killarney House & Gardens.\nThis well-maintained residence is situated in a highly sought-after, quiet and mature residential area, enjoying an attractive outlook over the green area. The property offers generous and versatile accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for families seeking a spacious home in an established and convenient location.\nOn the ground floor, the accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, sitting room, and a spacious living room with access from both the hall and kitchen. The bright, south-facing kitchen/dining room overlooks the private, cobbled rear garden and provides an excellent space for everyday family living and entertaining. There is also a utility room, a bedroom, and a Jack & Jill shower room completing the ground-floor accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are four further bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a main family bathroom.\nTo the rear, the well-laid-out garden provides a private outdoor space, while a substantial cavity-built shed offers excellent potential for conversion into a home office, gym, studio or additional recreational space.\nWith its generous living accommodation, excellent location and established surroundings, this property presents an excellent opportunity for new homeowners to settle into a mature residential area within easy reach of Killarney town centre and its many amenities.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful family home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.2 x 1.76\nTiled, cornicing\n\nSittingroom - 5 x 4.9\nMarble fireplace, laminate timber flooring, cornicing\n\nLiving Room/Family room - 3.7 x 4.2\nAccessible from hall and kitchen, laminate timber flooring, mahogany surround marble fireplace with oil fired stove\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.7 x 4.6\nCream kitchen units, with integrated double oven, hob and extractor fan\n\nUtility Room - 3.7 x 2.9\nOak built in units, sink\n\nBedroom One/Gym/Office - 4.3 x 2.75\nBuilt in wardrobe. Laminate timber floor.\n\nJack and Jill Shower room - 1.66 x 2.4\nAccessible from bedroom one and hallwayWetroom shower, wc, vanity unit wash hand basin, fully tiled floor and ceiling\n\nFIRST - \n\n\nLanding - 2.8 x 2\n\n\nHotpress/Linen closet - \n\n\nBedroom Two - 3.2 x 3.9\nBuilt in wardrobe, vanity unit with wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Three (Master) - 4 x 4.7\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nEn suite - 2 x 1.6\nShower, wc, wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Four - 4.1 x 3.4\nVanity unit with wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Five - 4.26 x 3.3\nVanity unit with wash hand basin\n\nBathroom - 2.85 x 1.9\nBath, separate electric shower, wc vanity unit wash hand basin, towel rail. Tiled floor and walls\n\nAREA - 165.4 sq. m./1,780 sq. ft.\n\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nShed - 3.9 x 3.25\nBright interior with two windows. Cavity wall built. Suitable as home office/gym\n\n"
      },
